---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { aboutStructuredData } from '../lib/structured-data';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Shiftby.pro, an independent fieldwork publication by Ananda Krishna Marri, covering AI-assisted research, systems, evidence and accountable practice." activeSection="about" ogImage={new URL('/images/social/shiftby-pro.png', Astro.site).href} ogImageAlt="Shiftby.pro independent fieldwork publication" twitterCard="summary_large_image" structuredData={aboutStructuredData(Astro.site)}>
  <article class="page-shell about-page">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="kicker">About the publication</p>
      <h1>Fieldwork from the middle of the work.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Shiftby.pro is an independent fieldwork publication by Ananda Krishna Marri about AI-assisted research, systems and accountable practice.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="editorial-body">
      <h2>Who publishes it</h2>
      <p><strong>Ananda Krishna Marri</strong> is an AI solutions, adoption and transformation leader with more than 20 years of experience across enterprise platforms, consumer health, pharmaceuticals, medical technology, manufacturing and supply chain environments.</p>
      <p>His current fieldwork examines how AI-assisted work can preserve context, evidence, decisions and human accountability as research, engineering and communication continue across tasks.</p>

      <h2>Why this publication exists</h2>
      <p>Each publication starts from real work: an implementation, research project, engineering decision or technical experiment. The aim is to show not only what was built, but why decisions were made, what evidence supported them, what did not work and what others can learn.</p>
      <h2>Evidence before certainty.</h2>
      <p>Current state is distinguished from historical rationale. Evidence strength is made visible. Limitations are retained. AI can assist with research, synthesis and drafting; human judgement retains publication authority.</p>
      <div class="article-callout"><strong>Independence and authority</strong><p>Shiftby.pro is an independent fieldwork publication. References to tools or platforms describe their contribution to the work and do not imply endorsement, certification or partnership. The accountable author remains responsible for interpretation, claim boundaries and publication decisions.</p></div>
      <h2>Continue into the work</h2>
      <p>Read the <a href="/projects/">projects</a> and browse the <a href="/fieldwork/">Fieldwork archive</a> to see the questions, evidence and implementation states behind the publication.</p>
      <p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/anandakrishnam/" rel="me">View Ananda Krishna Marri’s professional profile on LinkedIn</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
